        "id": 257241,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2024-03-12T16:33:35.146Z",
        "cooked": "<p>What the heck song was Christopher referencing there? c_c All I can think of is that weird “Walk in the Rain” song from Cowboy Bebop.</p>\n<p>The surgery is tomorrow! All of us here at… my apartment where I live by myself wish Christopher a safe, effective surgery and a speedy, complete recovery!</p>\n<p>“I don’t have feelings other than RAGE and SHOOT.” That’s our Expatriette!</p>\n<p>What are the odds someone in a comic accused Jefferson Knight of being a loose cannon and/or demanded his badge, etc.?</p>\n<p>I cannot overstate how much I love this “fans of a show that doesn’t exist” bit. How they get into it, then pause to giggle, then go right back to it. If I had to pick one reason I listen to this show, that would be it. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>\n<p>Please, no one ever write in with philosophical topics again, that segment almost put me to sleep a second time x_x</p>\n<p>I can only imagine a ‘villain Guise’ story would read like an episode of Looney Tunes.</p>",
