        "cooked": "<p>Nightwish reference! I can see Harpy having OPINIONS on which lead singer is better.</p>\n<p>When they kept talking about KNYFE’s musical tastes, I keep thinking of these guys: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UULJkItZuKE\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UULJkItZuKE</a></p>\n<p>Now I’m wondering who likes The Hu, Daft Punk, and who is the cover bands fan? (Okay, probably the last is Benchmark…)</p>",
