        "name": "Jeysie",
        "username": "Jeysie",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2024-03-25T11:08:25.450Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"FrivYeti\" data-post=\"4\" data-topic=\"30661\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/48/1919_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> FrivYeti:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I choose to take that to believe that Comicsgate simply didn’t happen in the Sentinels metaverse</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Sorry for the double post, but, I was wrong. Adam, at least, has made comments on his server indicating he’s aware of ANAD and buys into the “Tumblrinas ruined things” rhetoric which is very concerning, so you absolutely should put your post about Comicsgate in a letter to TLP about this because I think it needs discussing where C&amp;A, and especially A, will see it.</p>",
